      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hello ​<user-mention data-id=\"107546\">@Windows</user-mention>,</p><p> </p><p>No, STM32MP2 will not support LPDDR5.<br/>For us, LPDDR4 and even DDR3L are not in EOF.<br/>Some partners can guarantee us some LPDDR4 and DDR3L provisioning.</p><p>BR,</p><p>Kevin</p></div>"
